    <subfield code="a">A subgenre of fantasy fiction featuring magic and supernatural creatures in contemporary urban settings; use for urban fantasy focusing on non-binary characters or themes.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
