  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">A positive feeling connected to queer community, activism, and/or culture that counters the impact of living in a discriminatory society.  Note that queer is used as an umbrella term for the LGBTQ+ community within this phrase.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Lesbians who are part of the BDSM scene and assume the dominant role in sexual relationships with a dominant/submissive dynamic.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">A sense of fellowship and overall unity of purpose, political interest, and/or community sympathies based on shared experiences as LGBTQ+ people.</subfield>
