  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">A form of consensual non-monogamy in which spouses agree to engage in sexual and/or romantic relationships with individuals other than their marriage partner, without regarding this as infidelity.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Books or other resources of information about places designed for the use of LGBTQ+ visitors or tourists, typically to direct travelers to establishments or attractions that are owned by, open to, or frequented by LGBTQ+ people. LGBTQ+ travel guides may also direct travelers to safe houses or businesses in places where LGBTQ+ people are otherwise unsafe or criminalized, as well as locations commonly used for cruising, or picking up casual sex partners.</subfield>
  </datafield>
