  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Bisexual people who are descended from Arab peoples and were born in the United States, or bisexual people born in Arab countries who live in or have a strong connection to the United States. Do not conflate with Muslim people.</subfield>
