    <subfield code="a">Professional or amateur/recreational sports players who are non-binary.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">A term used in gender studies and feminist writing to describe a setting or culture in which sexual violence is pervasive and normalized due to attitudes about gender and sexuality.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">A term used to describe the phenomena of heterosexual or hetero-presenting individuals expressing curiosity about exploring sexual relationships or experiences with other people of the same gender.</subfield>
  </datafield>
