  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Written literary works for an audience of readers up to 12 years of age, also known as kid lit or juvenile literature. Use in reference to children's literature focusing on LGBTQ+ characters or themes.</subfield>
