  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">A term that originated in aromantic and asexual spaces to describe committed intimate relationships between significant others that are not romantic in nature.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Organized efforts to secure reproductive rights, including the legal, social, and ethical principles of freedom around reproductive healthcare and decision-making.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="680" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Organized public or social occasions for lesbians and lesbian communities.</subfield>
